  - signal processing

abstract: >
  SiMuR Tools is a MATLAB toolbox designed for the analysis of human motion
  using wearable sensors and biomechanical signal processing techniques.
  It provides utilities for data processing, synchronization, and analysis
  of kinematic signals.

